    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akamalalu kaNebukadineza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarula khumuruchi Nebukadineza, koole khubetsimbia tsiosi, namahanga, netsinimi abamenya mushialo shiosi pe; Omulembe kumeeteshenje khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie enduutsi mbu nobulayi okhurumbula akebilolelo nebiamakana ebia Nyasaye Ouli Ikulu Muno yakholela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie Nebukadineza ndali nimenyanga ewanje nindilambisiye, akanje kosi nikakaasanga munzu yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndaloora lilooro eliariisia, tsinganakani tsianje nindi khushitali, namalolelo akomumurwe, nibimbendia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho ndakhupa omulome mbu abachesi bosi baBabeli baleerwe imbeli wanje, mbu bambuulile eshisina shielilooro tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibeetsa, abafumu nabobulookooli nabaKalidayo nabakhwenyi; nasi nimbatoonyela akelilooro tsana; ne bakhaywa okhumbuulila eshisina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olunyuma lwabosi Danieli niyeetsa imbeli wanje, owakulikhwa mbu Beleteshazari khuliira lianyasaye wanje, nowa roho yabanyasaye abatakatifu yili muye; nasi nindoonya akelilooro imbeliwe, ndi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Beleteshazari, omwami wabafumu, emanyile mbu roho yabanyasaye abatakatifu yili mwiwe, khandi mbu libulaho libiso liosi elikhukhaya ta. Lilooro elia endoorile ndielino; umbuulile eshisina shialio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amalolelo akomumurwe kwanje nindi khushitali ngakano; mbu ndalola omusaala, ngwokwo, hakari weshialo, omurambi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusaala tsana nikukhula, nikukhulumama, oburambi bwakwo nibuula mwikulu, okwene nikulolekha kata okhuula khushihesi shieshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasaafu kakwo kali amalayi, ebiamo nibiba ebinji; kwalimwo ebiokhulia biabandu bosi. Tsisolo tsiomubulimo nitsinyoola eshiinikha hasi wakwo, nako amanyonyi akomwikulu nikamenya mutsisaka tsiakwo; ebindu biosi ebili nemibili nibinyoola ebiokhulia khukwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumalolelo akomumurwe kwanje nindi khushitali, ndalola, ngwoyo, omurangaali omutakatifu, niyeekha okhurula mwikulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nalanjisia nasunga ari Reme omusaala, nimutsosola tsisaka; bungulusie amasaafu kakwo, nimusalaasia ebiamo; tsisolo tsirule ewa tsili hasi wakwo, namanyonyi okhurula mutsisaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa leshe eshisichili shieshisina shiakwo mwiloba nikuboyilwekhwo eshibohelo shieshibia nomukasa, mumuboka okwomubulimo. Anyire omubili khulwa eliime lielikulu; omukabokwe kube halala netsisolo mubunyasi bweliloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyokwe kukalukhane, kuleshe okhuba kwomundu; ne aheebwe omwoyo kweshinasolo; ebise musaafu bimubirekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshiina shino shikhupwa omulome nabarangaali; obukhalachi buno nibuboolwa nelikhuwa liabatakatifu; mbu abali mwoyo bamanye mbu Oyo Ouli Ikulu Muno arukanga muburuchi bwabandu, nabumuheelesia owa achama, niyeemekha khubwo omundu ouli hasi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilooro lino isie, omuruchi Nebukadineza, endiluutsi; nawe, Beleteshazari, khabuule eshisina shialio, shichila abachesi bosi abomuburuchi bwanje bakhayilwe okhumanyia eshisina; nebutswa iwe onyala, okhuba roho yabanyasaye abatakatifu yili mwiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Dauieli, owakulikhwa mbu Beleteshazari, yang'ang'aalakhwo eshise, amapaaroke nikamuriisia. Omuruchi nasunga mbu Beleteshazari, lilooro lino lileshe okhukhuriisia, kata eshisina shialio. Beleteshazari nakalusia namusunjila mbu Omwami, lilooro lino libe khubakhukiya, neshisina shialio khubasukubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbu omusaala okwa oluutsi, okukhulile nikukhulumama, oburambi bwakwo nibuula mwikulu, nikulolekha khushihesi shieshialo shiosi pe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okwa amasaafu kakwo kali amalayi, nebiamo biakwo ebinji, nikubamwo ebiokhulia biabandu bosi; okwa tsisolo etsiomubulimo tsimenyanga hasi wakwo, amanyonyi akomwikulu nikali nebimenyo biako mutsisaka tsiakwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho niwe, omwami omuruchi, owakhula noba owamaani; okhuba obukhulundubwo bukhulile nibuula mwikulu, nobwamibwo okhuula khushihesi shieshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shinga olwa omuruchi aluutsi omurangaali omutakatifu niyeekha okhurula mwikulu naboola mbu Reme omusaala nimukutibia; nebutswa leshe eshisichili shieshisina shiakwo mwiloba nikuboyilwekhwo eshibohelo shieshibia nomukasa, mumuboka okwomubulimo. Anyire omubili khulwa eliime lielikulu; omukabokwe kube halala netsisolo etsiomubulimo, okhuula olwa ebise musaafu bilaba nibimubirilekhwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eshisina shieshino, omwami omuruchi; mbu nomulome kwa Oyo Ouli Ikulu Muno okuulile khumwami wanje omuruchi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu witsa okhwilusibwa mubandu, mana eshimenyoshio shilaba halala netsisolo etsiomubulimo; olaayanga obunyasi shinga ing'ombe, nonyira omubili khulwa eliime lielikulu; ne ebise musaafu bilakhubirakhwo, okhuula olwa olamanya shinga olwa ali Oyo Ouli Ikulu Muno ourukanga muburuchi bwabandu nabumuheelesia owa achama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shinga olwa balakwa okhulekha eshisichili shieshisina shiomusaala, nindio oburuchibwo bulakhutinyisilibwa olunyumakhwo, nomalile okhumanya mbu Likulu nilio elirukanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, omwami omuruchi, ofuchiilile obuchesiyii bwanje, nokhalaka ebionoonobio nokhola akobulunjishi, nobumayaanubwo nobabeela abasandibwa tsimbabasi; mbu mana haundi tsindaalotsio tsiomulembe tsirambihe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kano kosi kamala kamukwile omuruchi Nebukadineza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunyuma Iwemiesi ekhumi nachibili, olwa yali nachendanga khushilama shieinzu yabaruchi baBabeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuruchi yasunga mbu Lino shinilio Babeli likhulundu, elia ndayoombaashe libe eshimenyo shiabaruchi, khulwa amaani kobunyali bwanje, okhulolosia oluyali Iwobukhulundu bwanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa omuruchi yali nashiboola, omwoyo kwarula mwikulu nikusunga mbu Omuruchi Nebukadineza, oboolelwa ori nanwa; mbu obwami bukhurulilekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolondwe mubandu, eshimenyoshio nashibe halala netsisolo etsiomubulimo; olaayanga obunyasi shinga ing'ombe, ne ebise musaafu bilakhubirakhwo, okhuula olwa olamanya shinga olwa ali Oyo Ouli Ikulu Muno ourukanga muburuchi bwabandu, namuheelesia owa achama oburuchi tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khushise shieneshio amakhuwa tsana koosibwa khuNebukadineza; mbu yalondwa mubandu, niyaaya obunyasi shinga ing'ombe, nanyira omubili khulwa eliime lielikulu, okhuula liswilie olwa liali nilirambiihe shinga amabaha ketsinditsu, namatereke shinga akamanyonyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
