          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwenaho amachesi kanje nikakalukha; nabwo obukhulundu bwanje neing'oono yanje nibingalushila khulwa oluyali Iwoburuchi bwanje; abakofu beshiina shianje nabaami banje nibakhaaba; nasi niralisibwa muburuchi bwanje, nimeetelwa obukhulundu obukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano isie Nebukadineza nimupaaka Omuruchi welikulu nimufumia nimuheelesia oluyali; okhuba ebikholebie biosi nebiobwatoto, tsinjilatsie nitsili tsinunji; ne abachendanga nibeechinjimisia, anyala okhubatiitiyia.",
          "type": "text",
